Package: printhub-pro
Version: 1.7.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3
Recommends: cups-client, curl
Suggests: chromium | google-chrome-stable | microsoft-edge
Maintainer: Bit Dream IT (AdvMedi) <bitdreamit@localhost>
Installed-Size: 300
Description: PrintHub Pro (AdvMedi by Bit Dream IT) - silent print hub
 AdvMedi by Bit Dream IT - Innovative Healthcare Solutions. Silent print
 bridge for browsers and Laravel with LAN sharing and queue failover.
 Local HTTP hub (127.0.0.1:9235) that silently prints PDFs and web
 pages to the default printer via Chrome headless or CUPS lp.
 Ships a systemd user service (auto-run at login, no root needed)
 plus an XDG autostart fallback for non-systemd desktops.
 Includes a Chrome extension in the companion ZIP (PrintHub-Pro-
 Extension) for browser integration.
